# Project-Specific Rules for prototype node.js embed web app

## Project Overview
This is a prototype web app using a mock screenshot as UI guidance. It has only one screen enabled on the menu. When "Performance Intelligence" is selected, it opens a new browser tab. The URL for that tab is generated by node.js which contains a signed JWT.

## Tech Stack
- node.js for the server, tailwind css, typescript

